==German==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|de|nl|stikstof}} (coined in 1789); roughly equivalent to {{m|de|ersticken}} + {{m|de|Stoff}}. Introduced by the Swiss physician Christopher Girtanner in 1791.<ref>Christopher Girtanner. ''Neue chemische Nomenklatur für die deutsche Sprache'', Berlin 1791, p. 11.</ref>

